---
import Figure from "../Figure.astro";
---
<Figure width="wide">
  <p class="lab">Tiers of consolidation</p>
  <ol class="steps-row" style="--n:5">
    <li><b>Episode</b>one attempt and its outcome</li>
    <li><b>Claim</b>a finding with its measured effect</li>
    <li><b>Method</b>a tool that worked</li>
    <li><b>Procedure</b>how the next run searches</li>
    <li class="w"><b>Weights</b>a LoRA adapter</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="steps-scale"><span>around the model · inherited by the next run</span><span>in the model</span></div>
  <p class="lab" style="margin-top:40px">The loop with DeltaServe</p>
  <ol class="steps-row arrows" style="--n:4">
    <li><b>Run</b>every transition is logged</li>
    <li><b>Select</b>weaker parent → stronger child</li>
    <li class="w"><b>Train</b>a LoRA adapter, while the engine keeps serving</li>
    <li><b>Trial</b>one more randomised option, kept if it wins</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="steps-back">↺ an adopted adapter serves the next proposals</p>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    <b>Culture consolidates in tiers</b>, each slower and more durable than the last. The first four live around the
    model and are inherited by the next run; the fifth changes the model itself.
  </Fragment>
</Figure>
